{"t":"PM","n":"Philip Morris International Inc.","nKo":"필립 모리스 인터내셔널","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":182.5,"chg":-1.59,"chgPct":-0.00864,"prev":184.09,"dayH":184.84,"dayL":181.44,"w52H":214.35,"w52L":146.35,"vol":6622769,"avgVol":6116580,"mcap":284454649856,"pe":26.64,"fpe":20.22,"eps":6.85,"feps":9.03,"pb":null,"div":6.4,"divY":0.0351,"beta":0.35,"short":14876445,"shortPct":0.0096,"shortRatio":3.29,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Defensive","sKo":"소비자 방어","i":"Tobacco","iKo":"담배","city":"Stamford","emp":84900,"web":"https://www.pmi.com","sum":"Philip Morris International Inc. operates as a tobacco company. The company offers cigarettes and smoke-free products, including heat-not-burn, e-vapor, and oral nicotine products under the IQOS, VEEV, and ZYN brands; and consumer accessories, such as lighters and matches. It also offers wellness products. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut.","sumKo":"Philip Morris International Inc.는 담배 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 IQOS, VEEV 및 ZYN 브랜드의 궐련형 전자 증기, 경구 니코틴 제품을 포함한 담배 및 무연 제품을 제공합니다. 라이터, 성냥 등 소비자용 액세서리도 포함됩니다. 웰니스 제품도 선보이고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1987년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷주 스탬포드에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":31762000000,"ni":9048000000},{"y":2023,"rev":35174000000,"ni":7813000000},{"y":2024,"rev":37878000000,"ni":7057000000},{"y":2025,"rev":40648000000,"ni":11348000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":10362000000,"ni":2141000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":10146000000,"ni":2438000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":11192000000,"ni":2817000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":11438000000,"ni":3313000000}],"eps":[{"q":"4Q2025","act":1.7,"est":1.7},{"q":"1Q2026","act":1.96,"est":1.831},{"q":"2Q2026","act":2.2,"est":2.05},{"q":"3Q2026","act":2.36,"est":2.316}]},"trend":[{"p":"0q","eps":1.821,"n":12,"rev":10843410700,"growth":0.0709},{"p":"+1q","eps":2.037,"n":7,"rev":10520009170,"growth":0.0395},{"p":"0y","eps":8.352,"n":17,"rev":43609032610,"growth":0.1077},{"p":"+1y","eps":9.026,"n":17,"rev":45699071560